        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p><em>Thanks to your study of the history of rhetoric, you confidently craft your speeches for widespread appeal.</em></p><p>When you use your @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.l4wRQT2MH0SsxmRQ]{Rousing Presence} or @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.4DGwBZ4uDLTaKql2]{Steadfast Challenge}, you can spend focus up to your ranks in <strong>Persuasion</strong> to affect that many additional targets.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">*</span></p><p>When you use @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.l4wRQT2MH0SsxmRQ]{Rousing Presence} or @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.4DGwBZ4uDLTaKql2]{Steadfast Challenge}, spend focus up to your ranks in <strong>Persuasion</strong> to add that many targets.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>When you use your @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.l4wRQT2MH0SsxmRQ]{Rousing Presence} or @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.4DGwBZ4uDLTaKql2]{Steadfast Challenge}, you can spend focus up to your ranks in <strong>Persuasion</strong> to affect that many additional targets.</p>"
        },
